items.content_md:
下面代码在 `free(a.p)` 与 `free(b.p)` 时会发生 double free。结构体含指针成员，赋值只是浅拷贝。请修复（保持两个对象各自拥有独立内存）：

```c
struct Buf { char *p; size_t n; };
int main(void) {
    struct Buf a; a.p = malloc(4); strcpy(a.p, "hi"); a.n = 4;
    struct Buf b = a;
    free(a.p); free(b.p);
    return 0;
}
```

answer.reference_code:
struct Buf { char *p; size_t n; };
struct Buf deep_copy(const struct Buf *o) {
    struct Buf b;
    b.p = malloc(o->n);
    memcpy(b.p, o->p, o->n);
    b.n = o->n;
    return b;            /* 值返回，调用方拿到独立副本 */
}
int main(void) {
    struct Buf a; a.p = malloc(4); strcpy(a.p, "hi"); a.n = 4;
    struct Buf b = deep_copy(&a);   /* 深拷贝：各自独立内存 */
    free(a.p); free(b.p);           /* 不再 double free */
    return 0;
}

